        ],
        "recommendation": "Only the values go through `maskEmails`; the keys are copied as they are. A caller that indexes fields by address — `logInfo(\"quota\", { [user.email]: 3 })` — writes `{\"ada.lovelace@example.org\":3}` to the logs, against the module's own promise (\"never writes a full e-mail address\") and GDPR Art. 5(1)(c). Mask the key too (`safe[maskEmails(key)] = …`) and cover it with a test.\n",
